<title>POLAND: NFI UNITS SEEN AT PLN 193.6 IN JUNE - POLL.</title>
<headline>NFI UNITS SEEN AT PLN 193.6 IN JUNE - POLL.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish brokerages see mass privatisation NFI units rising to 193.57 zlotys in mid-1997, 10.5 percent less than predicted a month ago, a poll by Nowa Europa daily showed.</p>
<p>It said brokerages expected the units to be trading at 155.7 zlotys at the end of January.</p>
<p>NFI units closed at 142 zlotys on Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
